&lt;li&gt;Ensure that technical and user documentation is accessible and easily understandable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salesforce Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of hands-on experience as a Business Analyst or Implementation Consultant specializing in Salesforce Sales Cloud and CPQ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience with &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce integrations&lt;/strong&gt;, specifically connecting CRM platforms with product-led systems and cross-functional tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to own the end-to-end delivery lifecycle, from initial conception and configuration through to launch and post-deployment support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certifications:&lt;/strong&gt; Salesforce Certified Administrator, Sales Cloud Consultant, or CPQ Specialist credentials are highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Analytical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong problem-solving mindset focused on continuous process improvement and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Driven Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;AI solutions&lt;/strong&gt; and their application in enhancing analytical workflows and data insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Critical Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to translate complex business requirements into scalable, high-quality technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of collaborating with diverse business teams and stakeholders to align goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Collaboration &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated strong ownership and the ability to communicate effectively and collaborate seamlessly with cross-functional, global teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter who takes initiative to find solutions independently and consistently delivers accurate, timely results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join us :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in a fast-paced, innovative environment that values continuous learning and professional growth. This role offers the opportunity to collaborate with cross-functional teams to make a direct impact on the business while driving strategic improvements. As a key contributor, you will help shape the future of our Salesforce-based processes and operational landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
