&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Developer Educator&lt;/strong&gt; to help us create best-in-class video, written, and hands-on education content for Webflow customers, and those who want to define the next phases of the web. You’ll present on camera as a developer educator, and,&amp;nbsp; to keep your skills fresh, you’ll build production grade sites using Webflow that we use in our education videos and courses. You’ll also keep your skills fresh by learning how to integrate Webflow with other services and technologies and then develop content demonstrating how.&lt;/p&gt;
