&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;You are a continuous learner with a true growth mindset, actively seeking feedback to hone your skills, support your team, and deliver work with purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;You are customer-obsessed, building deep empathy for user challenges and anchoring every technical recommendation in solving real-world problems.&lt;/p&gt;
