&lt;p&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;We recognize that people come with a wealth of experience and talent beyond just the technical requirements of a job. If your experience is close to what you see listed here, please still consider applying. Diversity of experience and skills combined with passion is a key to innovation and excellence; therefore, we encourage people from all backgrounds to apply to our positions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Building the world’s leading&amp;nbsp;full-stack fulfillment platform&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;challenging&amp;nbsp;work. The problems we solve are complex, the pace is fast, and the bar is high.&amp;nbsp;That means&amp;nbsp;ShipBob’s&amp;nbsp;environment&amp;nbsp;isn’t&amp;nbsp;the right&amp;nbsp;fit for everyone, and&amp;nbsp;that’s&amp;nbsp;okay.&amp;nbsp;If you are ready to take ownership,&amp;nbsp;push boundaries, and&amp;nbsp;grow alongside a team that genuinely supports each other, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Learn more about our core values and how we perform at a high level in our day-to-day work on our Culture page (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.shipbob.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.shipbob.com/careers/culture/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;About Us: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob is a leading global supply chain and fulfillment technology platform designed for SMB and Mid-Market ecommerce merchants to provide them access to best-in-class capabilities and to deliver a delightful shopper experience. Merchants can outsource their entire fulfillment operations, utilize &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; proprietary warehouse management system for in-house fulfillment, or take advantage of a hybrid solution across &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; dozens of fulfillment center network in the United States, Canada, United Kingdom, Europe, and Australia. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; is backed by leading investors like Menlo Ventures, Bain Capital Ventures, Hyde Park Venture Partners, and SoftBank Vision Fund 2, and is one of the fastest-growing tech companies headquartered in Chicago.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At ShipBob, every full-time employee gets access to our best-in-class AI and productivity tools from Day 1 at no cost. This isn&#39;t a pilot or a perk for select teams. It&#39;s standard for everyone. We believe innovation isn&#39;t owned by one department. Whether you&#39;re in Talent, Operations, Finance, Engineering, or Customer Success, we expect you to ask: &lt;em&gt;how can this be done better, faster, or smarter?&lt;/em&gt; These tools are our investment in your ability to find those answers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI-Assisted Tools During Recruitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use AI-assisted tools during the recruitment process to support administrative functions such as transcribing interviews, generating summaries or notes, organizing interview feedback, facilitating candidate communications, and helping recruiters identify candidates whose qualifications may align with job requirements. These tools are designed to assist our recruiting team and are not used to make final hiring decisions.&amp;nbsp;Hiring decisions are made by trained human reviewers who consider the candidate&#39;s application, interview performance, qualifications, experience, and other relevant factors. AI-assisted tools do not independently determine whether a candidate advances in the hiring process or receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;Where required by applicable law, candidates will be provided with notice regarding our use of AI-assisted technologies and, where available, information about any applicable rights relating to such processing, including the ability to request additional information or opt out of certain AI-assisted processing activities. Candidates who exercise available opt-out rights may be reviewed through alternative processes consistent with applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;ompensation&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;and training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There is no deadline to apply for this position, as ShipBob accepts applications on an ongoing basis&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company, freeing people and agents to ship what&#39;s next. For more than a decade we&#39;ve helped builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now we&#39;re scaling our products for both agents and people to ship and run software, built in the open and trusted by OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Deal Desk Analyst to join the Deal Desk team within our Revenue Operations function. This is a high-impact, high-visibility role at the center of how we structure, price, and close business globally — partnering with Sales, Finance, Legal, and Product to turn deals into signed revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the quote-to-contract execution cycle for our global sales team while helping build the systems, processes, and playbooks that scale a world-class Deal Desk. As the organization continues through a period of rapid growth, we are looking for someone who wants to shape the function rather than inherit it — bringing structure to ambiguity, modernizing how deals get done, and raising the bar for commercial excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position reports to the Senior Manager, Global Deal Desk, and is preferably based in a hybrid capacity out of our San Francisco headquarters, working standard US business hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal Management — Own the day-to-day deal review and closing process end to end, including deal approvals, deal structuring, and quote configuration within Vercel CPQ, ensuring every deal is executed accurately and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercialization &amp;amp; Execution — Drive deal execution in close partnership with Finance, Legal, GTM, Partnerships, Product, and Pricing. Design, build, and continuously optimize the sales and deal processes that bring new pricing, packaging, and product launches to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted Advisor — Serve as the subject-matter expert for the Sales organization, providing deal guidance and operational support. Approach complex, non-standard deals with creativity and sound judgment, developing practical solutions in ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue Integrity — Act as the gatekeeper of data hygiene and opportunity data, partnering with GTM and Finance on audits for revenue recognition, financial reporting, and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insights &amp;amp; Enablement — Analyze deal performance and market trends to develop new sales motions, deal levers, and training materials that increase sales velocity and reduce business risk, in partnership with the Pricing and Field Enablement teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Excellence — Identify opportunities to streamline, enhance, and automate processes. Translate needs into clear business requirements and leverage AI and automation to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in deal desk, pricing, quote-to-cash, contract management, or a related Revenue Operations or Sales Operations function within the technology sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven record of partnering effectively with Sales and cross-functional teams to move complex deals forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in project management and process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team member who consistently delivers excellent sales support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A resourceful self-starter with strong critical-thinking and creative problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think naturally about operational implications and downstream impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in fast-paced, high-growth environments and operate effectively amid change and ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Salesforce CPQ (or a comparable CPQ platform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of using AI or automation to improve operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus If You:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re located within San Francisco Bay Area (HQ). We have offices for you to help build our office culture! This role is primary focus on Pacific Standard Time (PST)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Compensation:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Learn and Grow - we provide mentorship and send you to events that help you build your network and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Time Off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We will provide you the gear you need to do your role, and a WFH budget for you to outfit your space as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The San Francisco, CA base pay range for this role is $125,000 - $150,000. Actual salary will be based on job-related skills, experience, and location. Compensation outside of San Francisco may be adjusted based on employee location. The total compensation package may include benefits, equity-based compensation, and eligibility for a company bonus or variable pay program depending on the role. Your recruiter can share more details during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;te-floating-button-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://vercel.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for more information on how we handle your data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Vercel is committed to fostering and empowering an inclusive community within our organization. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, gender expression or identity, sexual orientation, national origin, citizenship, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Vercel encourages everyone to apply for our available positions, even if they don&#39;t necessarily check every box on the job description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Order Management sits at the center of how Figma turns contracts into revenue — every deal our Sales team closes passes through this team before it is invoiced. As part of Revenue Operations within Accounting, the team owns order form review, invoicing, and billing support for a global customer base. As Figma grows, this manager will lead the people and day-to-day operation behind that work: setting priorities, developing the team, owning quality and escalations, and leading Order Management readiness for product, pricing, and system changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role that can be held from one of our US hubs or remotely in the United States, preferably during Pacific timezone hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead day-to-day order processing from contract review and order entry through invoicing, setting priorities, managing queue health and SLAs, and stepping into the most complex work and escalations when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach, and develop designated offshore KMC employees and one Senior Order Management Analyst FTE, with clear goals, recurring feedback, quality expectations, and growth plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own team quality by establishing review standards, monitoring error and backlog trends, and turning recurring issues into coaching, documentation, controls, or process changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Order Management UAT for new products, SKUs, pricing models, and billing system releases — defining coverage, assigning and executing tests, triaging defects, and communicating launch readiness and risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Order Management support for month-end and quarter-end close, including backlog and escalation management, reconciliations, accruals, and cross-system data integrity, while maintaining SOX controls and audit-ready documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Revenue Accounting, Revenue Transformation, Deal Desk, Sales Ops, Biz Sys, Billing Engineering, Tax, and Legal to resolve issues and deliver scalable order-to-cash improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in order management, order-to-cash, billing operations, or revenue operations at a SaaS company, or equivalent depth of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership through people coaching, team coordination, quality ownership, or cross-functional project leadership; prior formal management experience is helpful but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how order entry decisions flow downstream into billing, revenue, collections, and reporting, including the control implications of those decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading UAT or system-change readiness, including test planning, cross-functional coordination, defect triage, and clear risk communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership, operational judgment, and communication skills, with a track record of creating clarity and maintaining quality under month- and quarter-end pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using or tuning automation — scripts, queries, workflows, or AI tooling — to remove manual work and improve team capacity in an operations process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience directly managing offshore or BPO employees in a public-company or SOX-controlled environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Disclosure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job level and actual compensation will be decided based on factors including, but not limited to, individual qualifications objectively assessed during the interview process (including skills and prior relevant experience, potential impact, and scope of role), market demands, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figma offers equity to employees, as well as a competitive package of additional benefits, including health, dental, and vision coverage; retirement benefits with company contributions; parental leave and reproductive or family planning support; mental health and wellness benefits; and paid time off. Figma provides paid sick leave, holidays, and other leave benefits in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws, including the requirements of the Washington Minimum Wage Act and related regulations. Exempt employees are eligible for employer‑provided paid flexible PTO in addition to flexible paid sick leave. PTO is subject to manager approval. Additional benefits may include company recharge days, cell phone and home internet reimbursements, and a number of lifestyle spending accounts. Figma also offers sales incentive compensation for most sales roles and an annual bonus plan for eligible non-sales roles. All compensation and benefits are subject to applicable plan terms and may be modified by Figma at any time, consistent with applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$127,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$183,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations-ext@figma.com&quot;&gt;accommodations-ext@figma.com&lt;/a&gt;. These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world&#39;s largest brands are consolidating their marketing, customer data, and service onto one platform, and more of them are choosing Klaviyo. That shift has made Enterprise our fastest growing segment, with our biggest customers spending well over seven figures a year and, this year, the largest deal in company history.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Large Enterprise Sales Manager, you&#39;ll lead 6 to 8 Account Executives who win new logos and grow our existing customers in the Western U.S. You&#39;ll bring out the best in each of them and turn those wins into a repeatable motion. Every deal your team lands is a household name the rest of the market notices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a leader who has built enterprise teams before and still loves being in the deal. In your first 90 days, you&#39;ll know the book and the top opportunities well enough to help in any of them. Twelve months in, you&#39;ll have delivered the year and grown average contract size through multi-product attachment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Own the number and the forecast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver team bookings against quarterly and annual targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call a commit the company can rely on, built from rigorous inspection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Keep the pipeline full&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect the coverage your team needs to hit its numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show AEs how to create territory plans, tier accounts, and map a buying group for every priority account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the standard of AE-led [prospecting / expansion] and what it produces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Win the big deals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharpen your AEs&#39; discovery, qualification, executive engagement, value cases, and negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step in yourself where it matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Grow the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire continuously and get new AEs productive quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run weekly 1:1s that invest in each seller&#39;s skills and career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weave AI into how the team operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Rally cross-functional partners&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with leaders across Klaviyo so your team never walks into a big meeting alone and has the support it needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry field insight to Product and Enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose what&#39;s holding the team back, fix what you can, and escalate the rest early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years leading quota-carrying enterprise AEs in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus 8+ years of enterprise selling with a record of personal overachievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to teach MEDDPICC or an equivalent methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of recruiting and developing enterprise sellers who self-source pipeline and hit targets consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building strong tool habits across a team, with Salesforce, Gong, Clari, and AI part of the everyday workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credibility with C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams that sell more than one product into the same account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: MarTech or ecommerce experience, ideally competing against Salesforce Marketing Cloud, Adobe, or Braze.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When we talk, be ready to walk us through a team you moved and a deal you personally changed. We&#39;ll go deep on both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires approximately 30 to 40 percent travel for customer meetings, executive briefings, partner work, and industry events.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range For US Locations:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$252,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By participating in Klaviyo’s interview process, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and will adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0auUcRqeYRczM9UoXAKldj&quot;&gt;Guidelines for using AI in the Klaviyo interview Process&lt;/a&gt;. For more information about how we process your personal data, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1axMoReIM1qwTbmaPcLI_b&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Klaviyo is committed to a policy of equal opportunity and non-discrimination. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, ethnicity, citizenship, national origin, color, religion or religious creed, age, sex (including pregnancy), gender identity, sexual orientation, physical or mental disability, veteran or active military status, marital status, criminal record, genetics, retaliation, sexual harassment or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
